AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - Synthesizing &#947;-butyrolactone (GBL),                comprises (1) introducing 1,4- butanediol (BDO)                from the 1,4-butanediol feeding pipeline into the                1,4-butanediol pre-heater, heating to a certain                temperature and entering into the 1,4-butanediol                vaporization tower, using the hydrogen as heat                carrier, mixing raw material 1,4-butanediol,                passing the mixed gas through the gas-liquid                separator and entering into reaction product                condenser, entering the liquid condensed by the                reaction product condenser and the gas phase cooler                into the &#947;-butyrolactone crude product                tank, (2) passing the &#947;-butyrolactone                crude product through feeding pump at bottom of                &#947;-butyrolactone crude product tank,                firstly entering the &#947;-butyrolactone                dehydrating tower feeding pre-heater for                preheating, entering the &#947;-butyrolactone                dehydrating tower for vacuum extracting and                separating, passing through                &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower top                condenser, and (3) vacuum extracting and rectifying                the &#947;-butyrolactone finished product                tower.
                    USE - The method is useful for synthesizing                &#947;-butyrolactone (GBL),
                    ADVANTAGE - The method has low acidity and high quality of                the final product, and has short process, high                yield, high social value and application                prospect.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - Synthesizing &#947;-butyrolactone (GBL),                comprises (1) introducing 1,4-butanediol(BDO) from                the 1,4-butanediol feeding pipeline into the                1,4-butanediol pre-heater, heating to a certain                temperature and entering into the 1,4-butanediol                vaporization tower, entering the hydrogen into the                1,4-butanediol vaporization tower, using the                hydrogen as the heat carrier, mixing the raw                material 1,4-butanediol until the temperature                reaches 164.5&#176;C, passing the mixed gas                through the gas-liquid separator at the top part of                the 1,4-butanediol vaporization tower, heating by                the hydrogen-alcohol heater and the                hydrogen-alcohol super-heater in sequence, entering                from the top tube side of the dehydrogenation                reactor, finishing the dehydrogenation conversion                reaction material from the bottom of the                dehydrogenation reactor under the action of the                catalyst, entering the reaction product-circulating                hydrogen heater A and the tube side of the reaction                product-circulating hydrogen heater B to exchange                heat with the shell side feeding material, and                entering into the reaction product condenser,                entering the liquid condensed by the reaction                product condenser and the gas phase cooler into the                &#947;-butyrolactone crude product tank,                cooling the gas phase by the gas phase cooler                enters the hydrogen circulating machine front                buffer tank, (2) passing the                &#947;-butyrolactone crude product through the                feeding pump at the bottom of the                &#947;-butyrolactone crude product tank,                firstly entering the &#947;-butyrolactone                dehydrating tower feeding pre-heater for                preheating, entering the &#947;-butyrolactone                dehydrating tower for vacuum extracting and                separating, maintaining the rectifying heat water                light component impurity of the system to be                separated from the tower top, passing through                &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower top                condenser, condensing liquid enter into                &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower reflux                tank, &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower                top produced to heavy component storage tank, tower                kettle produced into &#947;-butyrolactone                finished product tower for rectifying and                separating through freezing water condensation                separation, and (3) vacuum extracting and                rectifying the &#947;-butyrolactone finished                product tower, cooling the gas phase material                &#947;-butyrolactone on the tower top by the                circulating water of the &#947;-butyrolactone                finished product tower condenser, entering into the                &#947;-butyrolactone finished product tower                reflux tank, entering part of the condensed liquid                enters into the &#947;-butyrolactone finished                product tower through the reflux adjusting valve,                entering part of the &#947;-butyrolactone                product into the normothermic machine perfusion                (NMP) device synthesis process of                &#947;-butyrolactone high tank through                &#947;-butyrolactone product collecting                pipeline or entering into the middle tank group of                &#947;-butyrolactone storage tank.An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is also included for a                &#947;-butyrolactone (GBL) synthesis system,                comprising a 1,4-butanediol (BDO) vaporization                tower, a gas-liquid separator, a circulating                hydrogen heater, a hydrogen alcohol heater, a                hydrogen alcohol super-heater, a dehydrogenation                reactor, a reaction product circulating hydrogen                heater, a &#947;-butyrolactone crude product                tank, a &#947;-butyrolactone dehydration tower,                a &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower                feeding pre-heater, a &#947;-butyrolactone                dehydrating tower top condenser,                &#947;-butyrolactone dehydrating tower reflux                tank and &#947;-butyrolactone finished product                tower.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow chart of the method                for synthesizing -butyrolactone (GBL) (Drawing                includes non-English language text).
